===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[thorough]] or [[complete]] manner.
#: {{ux|en|He went out in the rain and came back '''thoroughly''' drenched.}}
#: {{ux|en|The editor looked '''thoroughly''' for any mistakes in the paper.}}

